WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.635
- ♪ Saving earth from space ♪

00:00:02.668 --> 00:00:05.638
♪ Power Falcons! ♪

00:00:05.671 --> 00:00:08.742
- [roars]

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:15.148
[falcon screech]

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.784
[growls]

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.786
- Yellow Falcon,
what do your senses tell ya?

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.154
- Destructo is
a killing machine.

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:22.088
- [growls]

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:25.158
- His armor is impervious
to our blasters.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:26.459
You got any ideas,
Red Falcon?

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.561
- Sure do, Yellow Falcon.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:31.431
Blue Falcon, you remember
our battle at Dango Bluff?

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.800
I'll take the legs,
you take the blasters.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.235
- It was Beaver Creek,
and I took the legs.

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:39.272
Make sure you shore up
that flank, Black Falcon.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:42.742
- Um, are you talking to me?

00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:45.344
Because I'm
the Green Falcon.

00:00:45.377 --> 00:00:46.813
- No time for that,
Black Falcon.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:48.347
Purple Falcon,
arm missiles!

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.782
- Roger that.
Arming missiles now.

00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:51.584
[machinery whirring]
- Uh--

00:00:51.617 --> 00:00:53.319
- Battle formations.
We're going in.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:54.720
- Hey.
- Roger that.

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:56.456
- Hold up.
- Copy that.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.124
- Roger.
- My falcon is green.

00:00:58.157 --> 00:00:59.358
- Hey, hey, hey.
We can talk about

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.428
our falcon colors when we get
back to base, Black Falcon.

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:04.197
Right now,
we got a mission to do.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.398
Fall into falcon formation.

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:08.501
[screaming, explosion]

00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:10.770
- Well, now, here's the issue
is that, you're gonna

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:13.673
give me an order, I'm not gonna
know you're talking to me.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:15.875
'cause...i'm not
in a Black Falcon.

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.877
- Come on, chill it out,
Black Falcon.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.413
- Yeah,<i> Black Falcon</i> ,
relax.

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:21.747
- First of all,
I don't like the way

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.616
you guys are saying "black."

00:01:23.649 --> 00:01:24.784
Second of all,
there is no Black Falcon!

00:01:24.817 --> 00:01:25.785
I'm Green Falcon!

00:01:25.818 --> 00:01:27.787
- Black Falcon, homie,

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.856
no one's trying to get up
in your grill here.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.892
- Uh-uh, uh-uh, uh-uh.
Don't talk to me like that.

00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:35.128
No, don't say "grill"
like that.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.797
I'm the<i> Green Falcon</i> ,
and i--

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.533
- Oh, stop being
so<i> Black Falcon</i> about it.

00:01:40.566 --> 00:01:42.168
- What the [bleep]
do you mean by that?

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.870
- Black Falcon, brother,

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.905
I understand
what you're going through.

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:48.174
- Do you?
No, I don't think you do.

00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:50.810
How would you feel if
I called you<i> Red Falcon</i> , huh?

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:51.811
- Whoa!

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:53.913
- and Purple Falcon,

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.450
how would you feel if I called
you<i> Yellow</i> Falcon, huh?

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.352
- That's racist.
- That was racist.

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.288
- Yeah, that's racist.
- Ooh, that is racist.

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:06.792
- That's racist?
Oh, see, okay, nope, forget it.

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:08.861
Black Falcon out--
Green Falcon!

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.664
[whoosh]
Green Falcon! Damn it!

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:15.334
- Hey! Why'd that Green Falcon
fall out of falcon formation?

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:18.171
Black Falcon,
get on that and report back.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.207
Black Falcon?
Black Falcon, come in.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.575
[rock music]
- ♪ Saving earth from space ♪

00:02:22.608 --> 00:02:24.074
♪ Power Falcons! ♪

